From 9990bba66464a311c44660449afceb276be34ed0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 14:03:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(chat): a short question about the weather is looked up,
 not left to the model (tester chat 15)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

„რა ამინდია დღეს თბილისში?" (conv 49108) was answered „I could not check
it, look at a weather app" with no tool called; the weather was meant to be
looked up (smallTalk.ts). asksTheWeather reads a short weather question that
states no need, and the run's first model call is then made with
tool_choice web_search, when the run has that tool. No prompt text changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
---
